oidissement, d’alimentation énergétique et de redondance pour satisfaire á la certification Uptime Tier 3. Nos installations permettront ainsi de garantir á nos clients un taux de disponibilité des ressources hébergées de 99,98% ce qui représente une indisponibilité annuel maximale de moins de 1h30mn.<span style="font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-9909d70-font-family ), Sans-serif; letter-spacing: var( --e-global-typography-9909d70-letter-spacing ); word-spacing: var( --e-global-typography-9909d70-word-spacing ); background-color: var(--ast-global-color-4);"> </span></p><p>Avec des services allant de l’hébergement de ressources communément appelé colocation, au cloud avec des partenaires tels que Microsoft Azure, AWS, ou encore Console Connect : sans oublier les solutions de sécurité managées via CCDOC ; nous sommes confiants que ce centre répondra aux besoins croissants de nos clients en matière de services sécurisés et de traitement rapide des données.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"px","size":22.4,"sizes":[]},"_animation":"fadeIn","eael_tooltip_section_content":"I am a tooltip","eael_ext_content_protection_password_placeholder":"Enter Password","eael_ext_content_protection_password_submit_btn_txt":"Submit","eael_ext_content_protection_password_incorrect_message":"Password does not match.","__globals__":{"text_color":"","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=9909d70"},"align":"justify","text_color":"#000000","typography_font_weight":"300","typography_word_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":"","sizes":[]},"_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"0f80af6","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Learn more",